review:
This is one of the best first person looter shooter I have played, game set on a beautiful alien planet and continues the storyline from the first entry in the series. One of the best sequels ever, and even in 2022 it looks and plays great. I spend countless amount of hours leveling and farming gear in this great game and can easily recommend it to almost everyone.

Pros:
- Timeless art style;
- Memorable characters;
- Awesome enemy roster;
- Amazing villain;
- Good optimisation;
- Great loot variety;
- Smooth and responsive controls;
- Outstanding soundtrack and voice acting;
- One of the best DLCs;
- Great arsenal;
- Engaging story and side quests;
- Great boss fights;
- Tons of content and replayability;
- Awesome location design;
- Great character progression;

Cons:
- Questionable writing;
- Overall gunplay is mediocre;
- One-sided endgame with bad balans and bullet sponge enemies;
- Too much references instead of world building;
- Humor is very hit-and-miss;
- Low quality gear are useless;
